      <div type="clause" n="4.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 4.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif gehadod man hine forwyrce mid deaþscylde, gewilde hine man ⁊ healde to bisceopes dome.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a man in orders places his life in jeopardy by committing a capital crime, he shall be arrested, and his case shall be reserved for the bishop's decision.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif gehadod man hine forwyrce mid deaðscylde, gewylde hine man ⁊ healde to bisceopes dome.</ab>
